    <entry_item>
      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠪᠣᠯᠪᠠᠰᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>bolbasu</uighur>
      <transcript>BOLBASU</transcript>
      <definition>[= bol, bolbal, conditional converb of bol-] a) If it is; if; if&apos; possible.b) Serves as an indicator of the subject: as far as ... is concerned; as for ...</definition>
      <page>116</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠪᠣᠯᠪᠠᠰᠣ ᠢᠷᠡᠲᠦᠭᠡᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- iretygei !</transcript>
          <definition> Do come, if possible !.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠡᠶᠢᠮᠦ ᠪᠤᠰᠤ ᠪᠣᠯᠪᠠᠰᠣ</unicode>
          <transcript>teimy busu --</transcript>
          <definition> If it is not so.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠡᠷᠡ ᠢᠷᠡᠺᠦ ᠦᠭᠡᠢ ᠪᠣᠯᠪᠠᠰᠣ</unicode>
          <transcript>tere ireky ygei --</transcript>
          <definition> If he does not come.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠪᠢ ᠪᠣᠯᠪᠠᠰᠣ</unicode>
          <transcript>bi --</transcript>
          <definition> As far as I am concerned; as for me.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠮᠣᠩᠭᠤᠯ ᠪᠣᠯᠪᠠᠰᠣ ᠠᠵᠢ ᠎ᠶᠢᠨ ᠨᠢᠭᠡᠨ ᠤᠯᠤᠰ ᠪᠣᠯᠪᠠᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>mongγul -- azi jin nigen ulus bolai, </transcript>
          <definition>Mongolia is one of the Asian countries</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠡᠷᠡ ᠪᠣᠯᠪᠠᠰᠣ ᠰᠠᠶᠢᠨ ᠺᠦᠮᠦᠨ</unicode>
          <transcript>tere -- sain kymyn</transcript>
          <definition> He is a good person.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
